    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063940/extras/3b00c10d434d07cbbf422c38668acc3c.poster.avif?t=1721417837\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063940/extras/3b00c10d434d07cbbf422c38668acc3c.webm?t=1721417837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063940/extras/3b00c10d434d07cbbf422c38668acc3c.mp4?t=1721417837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Embark on a cozy adventure in this open-world RPG to explore the enchanted forest\u2019s diverse regions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063940/extras/fd1cd4e0a2e5d1192fe204062ee9ae0d.poster.avif?t=1721417837\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063940/extras/fd1cd4e0a2e5d1192fe204062ee9ae0d.webm?t=1721417837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063940/extras/fd1cd4e0a2e5d1192fe204062ee9ae0d.mp4?t=1721417837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Gather resources to fuel your magical powers on the hand-crafted journey filled with captivating quests and secrets. Throw exploding elements or fly high over the horizon.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063940/extras/71faeb2a03d52330ae96b61114c3a1c9.poster.avif?t=1721417837\" width=600 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063940/extras/71faeb2a03d52330ae96b61114c3a1c9.webm?t=1721417837\" type=\"video/webm; c